{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME BACK, MR. FREEMAN. EPISODE ONE OF<i> THE LEGACY COLLECTION</i> IS HERE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Half-Life Legacy</strong></i></u><i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i>is the ultimate restoration for the legendary title originally created by Valve. This Mod by<strong> The Phoenix Project Software</strong> boasts faithful restorations, and full compatibility with the HL25 engine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FULL CAMPAIGN, BETTER THAN YOU REMEMBERED IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legacy allows you to play through the entirety of<i> Half-Life</i> just like it's 1998. We've introduced many minor fixes into the game, such as resolving Z-fighting issues, and more; we have given the game a polish to assure a pixel-perfect experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HALF-LIFE 1; WITH ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements have arrived in<i> Half-Life.</i> There is an achievement for completing each chapter, but additionally, we have scattered more around the game for you. Time to go on a hunt!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIME FOR A SPEEDRUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Half-Life Legacy\u00a0</i>we have removed the Bunnyhop speed-cap, meaning you can now speedrun the game and go as fast as you want. Let's see if you can make a new world record.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL THE RESTORED FEATURES FROM THE ORIGINAL VERSION + HL25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can expect to see all the features we restored back in 2020, plus, every feature from HL25 including but not limited to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewmodel bob tilt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD-compatible HUD scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OpenGL texture filtering option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Removal of bunnyhop speed-cap</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there's also features and options exclusive to<i> Half-Life Legacy:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weapon lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VGUI2 implementation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autojump option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Censorship filter option mimicking the 1998 German release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements + Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Presence for Steam &amp; Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced controller support using Steam Input \u2014 PS Light Bar, vibration, and Impulse Triggers</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're just as bad as them.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/f50859ede9dd7cca9c468090da59851b4a64d838.jpg"},{"name":"Zapped to oblivion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/8e23faff5f0ca701b7a07a2e4cf16af07d3cc1ce.jpg"},{"name":"Poor Big Momma...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/df77de3931c19e9a55efe52157b83f794fd7d820.jpg"},{"name":"On-the-Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/851acd9d6b2c30cd7094ced6a68477cb0e064962.jpg"},{"name":"Settled in!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/aee57d3c41b7648505feadb891da4db2235c224a.jpg"},{"name":"Morning, Mr. Freeman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/65fa12dbc1aab20e5095678dba60f6a709f9818f.jpg"},{"name":"A small discrepency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/aed942cdbe7e5ef20c68cd73df53888bf8fb3623.jpg"},{"name":"To the surface","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/0a99929fd66f63b320d1bddb6d90750eaa0c907b.jpg"},{"name":"Bad day to be Dr. Newell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/6af31b7dddbce864855a7f3d0717b6432ba963ec.jpg"},{"name":"Bad day to be part of the Science Team","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3619040/95bcb8f381b13ccf21d468e4aef737516ff07284.jpg"}],"total":68},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619040?t=1768511459","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619040/e6b499557c21b85b7c1f4f43804a3be60f91a513/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768511459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619040/491acff41265eef7f76f64a646fb6e77ffbe7940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768511459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619040/491acff41265eef7f76f64a646fb6e77ffbe7940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768511459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Though the graphics are dated, Half-Life 1 depicts violence in a somewhat realistic [for the time] but not in an over-the-top way. Players are able to shoot down hordes of alien species alongside villainous Government soldiers; essentially, it is a \"shoot or be shot\" scenario. However, through ways of cheat commands, players are able to, in the opening levels as well as throughout the game, shoot or beat down their allies. Human and alien blood is depicted as red and yellowish respectively and with enough damage, enemies can be \"gibbed,\" which is when a subject essentially explodes resulting in debris consisting of bodily parts. As aforementioned, as the visuals have aged, they may seem rather tame compared to modern standards."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>FULL CONTROLLER SUPPORT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Half-Life Legacy</strong> boasts full Controller support. Plug in &amp; play!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME BACK, MR. FREEMAN. EPISODE ONE OF<i> THE LEGACY COLLECTION</i> IS HERE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Half-Life Legacy</strong></i></u><i><strong>\u00a0</strong></i>is the ultimate restoration for the legendary title originally created by Valve. This Mod by<strong> The Phoenix Project Software</strong> boasts faithful restorations, and full compatibility with the HL25 engine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FULL CAMPAIGN, BETTER THAN YOU REMEMBERED IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legacy allows you to play through the entirety of<i> Half-Life</i> just like it's 1998. We've introduced many minor fixes into the game, such as resolving Z-fighting issues, and more; we have given the game a polish to assure a pixel-perfect experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HALF-LIFE 1; WITH ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements have arrived in<i> Half-Life.</i> There is an achievement for completing each chapter, but additionally, we have scattered more around the game for you. Time to go on a hunt!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIME FOR A SPEEDRUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Half-Life Legacy\u00a0</i>we have removed the Bunnyhop speed-cap, meaning you can now speedrun the game and go as fast as you want. Let's see if you can make a new world record.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL THE RESTORED FEATURES FROM THE ORIGINAL VERSION + HL25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can expect to see all the features we restored back in 2020, plus, every feature from HL25 including but not limited to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewmodel bob tilt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD-compatible HUD scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OpenGL texture filtering option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Removal of bunnyhop speed-cap</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there's also features and options exclusive to<i> Half-Life Legacy:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weapon lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VGUI2 implementation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autojump option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Censorship filter option mimicking the 1998 German release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements + Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Presence for Steam &amp; Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced controller support using Steam Input \u2014 PS Light Bar, vibration, and Impulse Triggers</p></li></ul>","developers":["The Phoenix Project Software SVG"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619040/517e9c574ed41d8f729e7334119e7bf0a3025bb9/header.jpg?t=1768511459","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2020-2026 The Phoenix Project Software SVG<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis title is a Community Mod for \"Half-Life\" and therefore, The Phoenix Project Software SVG is not affiliated with Valve other than the publishing of this title. This is not, and should not be, considered an official Valve-developed Half-Life game.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce 8600 / ATI Radeon HD2600<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 562 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619040/1465423201/5094921d590290e9d7a9ab84ec1c0a077f8a7606/1763504179/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763669422","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619040/1465423201/5094921d590290e9d7a9ab84ec1c0a077f8a7606/1763504179/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763669422","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619040/1465423201/5094921d590290e9d7a9ab84ec1c0a077f8a7606/1763504179/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763669422","id":257234090,"name":"Steam Release Date Trailer (2025)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257234090/b25e2b53453ca18a7add6d37f7f581fd286eb215/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763669422"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619040/854206404/10da4e7929540b170d6e7189fbacf0186c798404/1757336828/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757887095","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619040/854206404/10da4e7929540b170d6e7189fbacf0186c798404/1757336828/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757887095","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619040/854206404/10da4e7929540b170d6e7189fbacf0186c798404/1757336828/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757887095","id":257164668,"name":"Steam Release T